我寿年龄外，后地与先天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26420,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"问庵佥宪马君宗孔求题圃中楼亭四首 其四 河泗环流","author":"湛若水","text":"河泗争流处，水流心不流。\n自流他自止，吾与止流休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26421,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"问庵佥宪马君宗孔求题圃中楼亭及八景，共十绝 其九 桑梓晴辉","author":"湛若水","text":"楼上望桑梓，依然见旧居。\n广居君认得，何处是吾庐？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26422,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"问庵佥宪马君宗孔求题圃中楼亭及八景，共十绝 其十 松楸暮霭","author":"湛若水","text":"亲在松楸下，松楸暮霭中。\n望亲存著外，松霭化为空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26423,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题杨生大中君极采芳卷","author":"湛若水","text":"采芳复采芳，采之何太勤？\n芳馨塞天地，吾自美灵根。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26424,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄题山泉吴兵部号也","author":"湛若水","text":"何以爱山泉，山泉静且清。\n安得挽之去？\n尽洗世间盲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26425,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"期邹谦之不至，走笔寄之","author":"湛若水","text":"我来我有期，我期天不知。\n寄语东郭子，可悟天人机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26426,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送夏官孙君文宿参藩四川诗","author":"湛若水","text":"直气叫阊阖，同听喜起歌。\n心将薇省月，送子到岷峨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26427,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题曾春官惟馨藏予小影","author":"湛若水","text":"无言是吾真，君若请益起。\n默识如愚外，曾子可与此。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26428,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"官源五景为洪侍御峻之五首 其一 洪鹿田","author":"湛若水","text":"高士昔乘鹿，还同鹿性驯。\n遗田千载下，更有远遗人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26429,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"官源五景为洪侍御峻之五首 其二 主龙山","author":"湛若水","text":"主龙何处是，烟火两三椽。\n静卧知龙德，他时或跃渊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26430,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"官源五景为洪侍御峻之五首 其三 官谷泉","author":"湛若水","text":"源泉官谷里，泉亦未忘官。\n泽物司云雨，西风卷却乾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26431,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"官源五景为洪侍御峻之五首 其四 天井峰","author":"湛若水","text":"天井无人汲，汲之愁太勤。\n忘助中间看，天人此处分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26432,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"官源五景为洪侍御峻之五首 其五 黄芝潭","author":"湛若水","text":"潭中何所有，白石映黄芝。\n坐来潭底影，照见本来谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26433,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题碧潭为丹山馆人朱挥使","author":"湛若水","text":"碧潭如碧天，天与碧相连。\n欲普乌龙泽，须借雷霆鞭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26434,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题马雪坡卷","author":"湛若水","text":"信步北城坡，忘却坡上雪。\n不知孟浩然，寻梅有何说。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26435,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送江君一桂之广右太平守","author":"湛若水","text":"使君刺太平，问讯太平治。\n太平本无象，人心平即是。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26436,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠李一夔分教海丰","author":"湛若水","text":"境土移毡近，罗浮就眼新。\n秪应徐节孝，扶持百年亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26437,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送古田尹何君世纶","author":"湛若水","text":"邂逅郎星使，知是古田侯。\n今我长怀古，因君问井丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26438,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中坐楼上书所见","author":"湛若水","text":"浊酒不得意，新诗空自酬。\n冥冥翳白日，郁郁坐穷愁。\n飞鸟冲风堕，归云被雨留。\n小舟还数点，寂寞在荒洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26439,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望罗浮","author":"湛若水","text":"对之不敢指，万丈立空青。\n影落沧溟得，高分日月明。\n阅人幽石老，无主野花馨。\n葛老遥相问，西云是友生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26440,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒崔菊坡祠","author":"湛若水","text":"玉颊碧瞳清，想公眉宇成。\n傍观知国手，遗表自丹青。\n日落西湖晚，云归剑阁灵。\n短词吟未罢，款款凤凰鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26441,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元默别后有怀","author":"湛若水","text":"闭门梦行李，白鸟没青天。\n好月将愁去，新梅对恼眠。\n相识波罗树，重看玉井莲。\n欲申花意思，临别已忘言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26442,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西云梅花盛开用元默西云韵","author":"湛若水","text":"梅花清太极，雪月与通灵。\n老树从心折，春风就手迎。\n映溪流不竞，脱蒂了无声。\n惊起罗浮梦，凭轩见八溟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26443,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赵元默得一鹤将致西云随即病死诗以悼之","author":"湛若水","text":"空山无一侣，托契九皋君。\n引吭轻寥廓，长鸣意绝群。\n世有三生血，吾兼一返魂。\n敢言屋乌爱，未必主人嗔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26444,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题易菊趣","author":"湛若水","text":"菊亦有何趣，渊明独赏真。\n后来爱花者，总是学陶人。\n秋露与佳色，南山对入神。\n不逢易居士，谁识白纶巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26445,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜梦谒石翁墓病中作","author":"湛若水","text":"黄云不可度，紫水乃无门。\n敛衽圭峰下，如公面目存。\n想极寻诗稿，哀馀有梦魂。\n平生游走意，他日夜台论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26446,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临病西云之下不得回送元默行舟聊此遣闷","author":"湛若水","text":"斜阳迎度马，落月下归舟。\n举棹意有适，卧家人独愁。\n倚树吟三叠，开帆过两洲。\n神仙本无累，吹笛酒家楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26447,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬至日一首","author":"湛若水","text":"年年有此日，此日苦无多。\n愁与初长刻，天来奈老何。\n新梅惊病眼，短句儗春歌。\n板筑过名节，黄鹂度翠萝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26448,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"板筑一首","author":"湛若水","text":"板筑非吾辈，心期鹿洞前。\n凿池得新月，伐竹见全天。\n翠嶂围高阁，黄云对小轩。\n仲冬岁癸亥，短咏记吾年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26449,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同元默弟游黄云洞马上口占","author":"湛若水","text":"联辔敲推入，溪桥风袂斜。\n两莺鸣并树，一路转三叉。\n紫府千回梦，青春二月花。\n直知天路杳，谁管暮归鸦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26450,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归云窝中卧看鸟群飞","author":"湛若水","text":"朋飞何处鸟，此去竟何之。\n有底轻心性，无家重别离。\n入云终自得，高翅与群疑。\n世网专相待，稻粮肥未肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26451,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将往谒先师石翁墓舟中写怀","author":"湛若水","text":"初定江门舸，中宵梦倚樯。\n精魂不可致，大道有遗光。\n雨过白龙出，云消紫水长。\n望坟欲饮泣，不觉泪沾裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26452,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大行孝宗皇帝挽词二首 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"泪穿无厚土，目窅有高旻。\n敬祖翻材艺，祈年蹶玉身。\n恤囚扬末命，放女陋前人。\n从有如椽笔，谁能画得春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26453,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大行孝宗皇帝挽词二首 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"退朝恭默处，座上见秋旻。\n十八全弘治，清修在侧身。\n折节延诸老，承平颂一人。\n亲王遗谕在，花萼自冬春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26454,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉题东山草堂为刘时雍少师","author":"湛若水","text":"正属苍生望，东山复此亭。\n檐虚湖与迥，景胜岳全轻。\n三径沿溪辟，千峰就榻迎。\n不留廊庙老，乞与草堂荣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26455,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潘黄门海珠诗次韵","author":"湛若水","text":"孤根分穗石，树影带城堤。\n泛泛星槎外，荒荒日驭西。\n两崖烟火断，一啸海云迷。\n便欲依僧寺，终同一鹤栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26456,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"腊二十八日宿三洲滩","author":"湛若水","text":"岁尽日阴雨，魂销夜荒汀。\n寂寞关河黑，咄嗟瘴雾腥。\n兵卫起风草，扪虱卧寒铃。\n心逐北流水，直到粤王城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26457,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过永淳县除夕夜宿道庄与潘黄门对酌二首 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"岁事催行李，时光只客船。\n历头忘了日，符面已新年。\n北斗天颜近，南溟地脉连。\n几时青鸟使，归侍玉皇前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26458,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]